      "title": "epan: Add tvb_strsize_enc, use it to speed up get_full_length",
      "message": "epan: Add tvb_strsize_enc, use it to speed up get_full_length\n\nImplement a function to get the length of a null-terminated string,\nincluding the terminator, with the encoding as an input. Use it in\nget_full_length to determine the full length for FT_STRINGZ with\nunknown length without having to copy the entire string.\n",
